\begin{abstract}
We introduce the notion of a graded comodule category with enough projectives. We show that the category of graded comodules over a graded Hopf algebra is a graded comodule category with enough projectives. We also show that the category of graded comodules over a graded Hopf algebra is a graded tensor category.
\end{abstract}

